					"nextDialogs": [
						4670306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 4670306,
					"content": "（咽口水）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4670307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4670307,
					"content": "唔…一言難盡的味道，勉強及格吧~！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4670308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 4670308,
					"content": "#咦？{NICKNAME}應該只是沒發揮好，不算不算~！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4670309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4670309,
					"content": "#嗯，只要多加練習，{F#妳}{M#你}還是很有潛力的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4670310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 4670310,
					"content": "#我的包裹裡還有一些生的食材，送給{F#妳}{M#你}吧，就當做這一餐的回禮。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4670311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 4670311,
					"content": "咦？這不太好吧，妳自己沒東西下鍋了怎麼辦？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4670312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4670312,
					"content": "#沒關係哦，<color=#00E1FFFF>野外探險</color>時可以搜集到很多食材，{F#妳}{M#你}們也可以多多留意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4670313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 4670313,
					"content": "<color=#00E1FFFF>「獵鹿人」餐館</color>也會有食材和料理出售，有空就去轉轉吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4670314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 4670314,
					"content": "嗯嗯，謝謝妳的情報…喂！留一點「野菇雞肉串」給我呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
